    "detailed_description": "<strong>What is &quot;love&quot;? \u2014 Discover lost memories and the meaning of love in a desolate world</strong><br><br>\u201cIn a World Without People\u201d is a side-scrolling pixel art adventure game set in a ruined, post-human world.<br><br>A mysterious plague swept across the globe, and humanity vanished.<br>The world fell silent.<br>\u2500\u2500 Nearly a thousand years later, a lone robot awakens.<br><br>As it wanders the decaying world, fragments of memories with humans slowly begin to return.<br>The robot continues to search\u2014until the moment it understands the emotion known as &quot;love.&quot;<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore: Walk through a desolate world</h2>Take control of the robot and explore a quiet, ruined world at your own pace.<br>Investigate mysterious places, use items you find along the way, and solve small puzzles to gradually uncover the story behind the silence.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314030/extras/d7c3a47deb5d765e0cf309516e1cecc0.avif?t=1751813743\" width=616 height=171 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Memory: A journey into the past</h2>The robot has lost all memory of who it was and what it once did.<br>By discovering old computers of the same model as its own head and transplanting their memory units, it begins to recover fragments of the past.<br>What emerges is the story of humanity's final days.<br>As the robot learns what &quot;love&quot; meant to this world, a new light begins to shine on its own fate.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314030/extras/6945e6558776ec9159ff2b0f9aa06cea.avif?t=1751813743\" width=616 height=171 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Art: A pixel world shaped by depth and light</h2>Enjoy a richly detailed pixel art world where lighting and depth bring every scene to life.<br>Carefully crafted visuals evoke both the stillness of a ruined world and a nostalgic sense of warmth.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314030/extras/14d25af7e38892a6e8c9556f172d6f68.avif?t=1751813743\" width=616 height=171 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Streaming and Video Content</h2>We generally welcome gameplay streaming and video uploads.<br>Please check the official guidelines via the \u201cVisit the website\u201d button on the right.<br>We also offer downloadable assets such as thumbnails on the same page.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>What is &quot;love&quot;? \u2014 Discover lost memories and the meaning of love in a desolate world</strong><br><br>\u201cIn a World Without People\u201d is a side-scrolling pixel art adventure game set in a ruined, post-human world.<br><br>A mysterious plague swept across the globe, and humanity vanished.<br>The world fell silent.<br>\u2500\u2500 Nearly a thousand years later, a lone robot awakens.<br><br>As it wanders the decaying world, fragments of memories with humans slowly begin to return.<br>The robot continues to search\u2014until the moment it understands the emotion known as &quot;love.&quot;<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore: Walk through a desolate world</h2>Take control of the robot and explore a quiet, ruined world at your own pace.<br>Investigate mysterious places, use items you find along the way, and solve small puzzles to gradually uncover the story behind the silence.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314030/extras/d7c3a47deb5d765e0cf309516e1cecc0.avif?t=1751813743\" width=616 height=171 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Memory: A journey into the past</h2>The robot has lost all memory of who it was and what it once did.<br>By discovering old computers of the same model as its own head and transplanting their memory units, it begins to recover fragments of the past.<br>What emerges is the story of humanity's final days.<br>As the robot learns what &quot;love&quot; meant to this world, a new light begins to shine on its own fate.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314030/extras/6945e6558776ec9159ff2b0f9aa06cea.avif?t=1751813743\" width=616 height=171 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Art: A pixel world shaped by depth and light</h2>Enjoy a richly detailed pixel art world where lighting and depth bring every scene to life.<br>Carefully crafted visuals evoke both the stillness of a ruined world and a nostalgic sense of warmth.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3314030/extras/14d25af7e38892a6e8c9556f172d6f68.avif?t=1751813743\" width=616 height=171 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Streaming and Video Content</h2>We generally welcome gameplay streaming and video uploads.<br>Please check the official guidelines via the \u201cVisit the website\u201d button on the right.<br>We also offer downloadable assets such as thumbnails on the same page.",
    "short_description": "A post-apocalyptic pixel art narrative adventure where a robot, awakened in a ruined world after humanity's extinction, traces its memories with humans and discovers \u201clove.\u201d In a quiet, beautiful, and lonely world, this is the story of a robot\u2014until it chooses to shut itself down.",
